{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07298","headline":"惠福寺与陈留诸官茶会 · 刘长卿","name":"惠福寺与陈留诸官茶会","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"到此机事遣，自嫌尘网迷。\n因知万法幻，尽与浮云齐。\n疎竹映高枕，空花随杖藜。\n香飘诸天外，日隐双林西。\n傲吏方见狎，真僧幸相携。\n能令归客意，不复还东溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07298.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07298","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}